            <div xml:id="m-56e66973-e730-4546-8d99-6a8176eea188">
              <lg xml:id="m-e2fd85dd-583b-4429-87da-c9f1b833c0e2">
                <l xml:id="m-4d4c5fdc-2f95-4c5d-995a-f500354304e7" facs="#m-45e4b3f8-29ae-40c7-9e96-48344e5ca9b8" label="ambiguous">436</l><l xml:id="m-1aa28dd3-beae-4b5b-8296-8431a38064d3" facs="#m-bd5ff0f3-c172-40bd-8f94-7d79b33e30f2" label="text-like">Sunday within the Octave of Christmas.</l><l xml:id="m-8e43b39c-992a-4790-81a5-8a4ce4c19729" facs="#m-b869913b-a872-4157-9b7e-406865249254" label="lyrics-like">Israel. Et ut perfecérunt ómnia scébat et confortabátur, plenus sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-f916cd12-c093-49e1-8c1d-bd6e69c26e41" facs="#m-9fe2a382-2dcc-4c0e-9158-fc5268db1191" label="lyrics-like">secúndum legem Dómini, revérsil piéntia: et grátia Dei erat in illo.</l><l xml:id="m-9c136709-51a2-4893-b9a3-859b553d1d54" facs="#m-7b7710dd-e614-457a-8069-4343649e04b0" label="lyrics-like">sunt in Galilaéam, in civitátem</l><l xml:id="m-094a0ccc-2b9c-4fd9-81a3-2b80bcc76a59" facs="#m-2f807546-3c14-43f3-9195-95210bff257f" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-e3f4d6fd-3f02-4711-b086-700166f00d96" facs="#m-a7ff5645-197f-4db1-8eb8-682a3ac60d69" label="lyrics-like">suam Názareth. Puer autem cre¬</l><l xml:id="m-f47bd7a0-c705-410e-9f73-b479ce088dd5" facs="#m-7932a0cc-2a71-4892-a266-4bea85b39d08" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Déus enim firmávit. p. 406.</l><l xml:id="m-a84e69f4-15e5-4f49-81f1-f79f5ad91caf" facs="#m-59f78959-6ea6-4d4f-8a9e-2fadc581d4f7" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-3a70476a-0750-4729-81d5-75a905d00c74" facs="#m-dff18216-655f-44e5-a0c6-ceaf97a38f78" label="lyrics-like">vOncéde, quaésumus omnípotens] piae devotiónis obtíneat, et effé¬</l><l xml:id="m-260503cd-3566-457e-8fcc-9a67050bb4b4" facs="#m-1466333a-8e58-4646-98bf-c3a7a16458cf" label="lyrics-like">UDeus: ut óculis tuae majestátis! ctum beâtae perennitátis acquirat.</l><l xml:id="m-ca0d70c0-069c-4396-ba83-1f9ce95d9e37" facs="#m-74352d57-c429-4930-9879-e778a3b5960c" label="lyrics-like">munus oblátum, et grátiam nobis ! Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-077a1f3e-4ba2-4e4a-b6a5-01ac209db007" facs="#m-e36ada9a-4a8e-4150-888c-9fc0ff15abdc" label="text-like">Commemorations are made as indicated on p. 434.</l><l xml:id="m-cef86975-52ab-49d5-97d7-0db5b128b44e" facs="#m-248e4375-491b-4571-908c-78b32914cb91" label="ambiguous">comm.¡</l><l xml:id="m-9cff081c-a37a-477a-9a2f-ecf7237de3e4" facs="#m-96be62e1-d732-4f18-be96-8c74b4a3bf57" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-047336ed-16d3-485e-84ba-b85b440c69cf" facs="#m-f6968387-53e2-45d6-adb3-7c3f844d3e40" label="lyrics-like">AOlle “ pú-e-rum et má- trem é-jus, et vá¬ de</l><l xml:id="m-7f609450-f1a2-4efd-bdf4-34cd9c24776c" facs="#m-7cbe1a9c-aa60-4263-81ea-4cb5a50b7e0f" label="lyrics-like">in térram Isra¬ el: de-fúncti sunt e- nim, qui quae¬</l><l xml:id="m-958e29fd-1c01-4a05-97a8-8b50fc2973df" facs="#m-4abe439d-a0ea-40d2-81d4-cb1dbdee45c8" label="lyrics-like">ré- bant ánimam pú-e- ri.</l><l xml:id="m-4f892665-3752-4b53-8d54-6af3d04d95b3" facs="#m-8b113351-892d-4a67-bbec-5a798c4a9e94" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-baa215c1-bb8b-4760-ade5-8a292aabcaf4" facs="#m-9fb63732-74a7-450c-ab1b-f7c848da79d1" label="lyrics-like">DER hujus, Dómine, operatió-] purgéntur, et justa desidéria com¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f107e7d-7530-44d6-9495-302a76bbb70f" facs="#m-c4db7d45-4668-4aa8-b814-c7d16390684e" label="lyrics-like">nem mystérii, et vitia nostra lpleántur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-bc22247c-8e63-47d0-b182-fd6c5101bcae" facs="#m-c6438f39-235f-4a5f-8462-6e3db1475462" label="text-like">Commemorations as on p. 434.</l><l xml:id="m-b51aa961-4517-4146-b99e-aed82dbe38de" facs="#m-aa845003-14f7-4b36-a069-7098e1f3dc4c" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-f49d098d-a83e-455f-87c4-02be50731c4a" facs="#m-66317815-e1b7-40fe-b97f-3cd5e8d7a0e2" label="ambiguous">Ant. Angelus. p. 397.</l><l xml:id="m-fbf24d4c-96fd-424d-be5c-f5ac08f70f1e" facs="#m-4f11ec6f-aafc-4089-886b-dd569c75fd0e" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-baaeba1a-6382-4e80-a853-e254f7a70a6e" facs="#m-7698879c-79a4-4244-bf77-dba3b5c91f86" label="ambiguous">Gal. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-887f6428-cb2c-4061-aff4-81251d3fb4bc" facs="#m-410490d4-030b-499e-949a-8646587c9846" label="lyrics-like">Tubi venit plenitúdo témporis, t eos qui sub lege erant, redimeret,</l><l xml:id="m-f41c2783-7665-4209-85f2-0ddabc268e3a" facs="#m-e560087c-aa03-4401-b83a-105624a41c85" label="lyrics-like">IA misit Deus Fslium suum factum lut adoptiónem filiórum reciperé¬</l><l xml:id="m-628ed700-67e3-4110-8413-d23f98c1fa26" facs="#m-08add1f3-4f99-4e58-bcdb-97d8739216dc" label="ambiguous">ex muliere, factum sub lege, ut! mus.</l><l xml:id="m-0db02186-d801-4bf6-b462-f1eb7b086a88" facs="#m-125060f8-f040-48e6-8ea4-9371bd5eef67" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Nótum fécit. V. Vidérunt ómnes. p. 411.</l><l xml:id="m-22c4858a-6fe5-485d-b2d0-b589feec7295" facs="#m-86f32c5c-ae2c-4cc2-8a84-cbdc05d1d9c8" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-edc65aaf-73ae-4258-952f-926ce6f91709" facs="#m-1041a352-1eb2-4913-b48b-2e9758537162" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Párvulus Filius. p. 399.</l><l xml:id="m-42a906b6-feb4-442f-962d-301df5ace22e" facs="#m-53fa1e53-c817-444a-acf7-af124b36afe1" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-7af8b769-59a7-4130-b01c-87427e896f42" facs="#m-5caa2827-c3cd-4993-925f-cdc5f71283df" label="ambiguous">Gal.4</l><l xml:id="m-37113257-9a8c-4725-9524-67a225d524b2" facs="#m-abc91436-db70-4354-87b4-d8696d7855a0" label="ambiguous">Taque jam non est servus, sed! per Deum.</l><l xml:id="m-ab5e3143-5fdf-4e93-8325-053ebfccf28e" facs="#m-e04742c5-1f78-4971-927e-6b904974c5b7" label="ambiguous">I filius:* quod si filius, et haeres</l><l xml:id="m-7bba1dad-e5bd-4a4a-bb7a-6cdd9aeb9397" facs="#m-300adf30-64ab-4459-89e3-cf7e38f2c2bf" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Vidérunt ómnes. V. Vérbum cáro. p. 111.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
